@startuml 窗口消息处理状态图
!theme cerulean-outline
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title Windows 消息处理状态机

[*] --> 运行中 : 程序启动

state 运行中 {
  state "应用活跃" as Active {
    Active : m_AppPaused = false
    Active : 执行游戏逻辑
    Active : 渲染场景
  }
  
  state "应用暂停" as Paused {
    Paused : m_AppPaused = true
    Paused : 不更新游戏逻辑
    Paused : 不渲染场景
    Paused : Sleep(100) 节省 CPU
  }
  
  state "窗口最小化" as Minimized {
    Minimized : m_Minimized = true
    Minimized : m_AppPaused = true
  }
  
  state "窗口最大化" as Maximized {
    Maximized : m_Maximized = true
    Maximized : m_AppPaused = false
    Maximized --> Active : OnResize()
  }
  
  state "正在调整大小" as Resizing {
    Resizing : m_Resizing = true
    Resizing : m_AppPaused = true
    Resizing : 暂停更新和渲染
  }
  
  [*] --> Active
  
  Active --> Paused : WM_ACTIVATE\n(失活)
  Paused --> Active : WM_ACTIVATE\n(激活)
  
  Active --> Minimized : WM_SIZE\n(SIZE_MINIMIZED)
  Minimized --> Active : WM_SIZE\n(SIZE_RESTORED)
  
  Active --> Maximized : WM_SIZE\n(SIZE_MAXIMIZED)
  Maximized --> Active : WM_SIZE\n(SIZE_RESTORED)
  
  Active --> Resizing : WM_ENTERSIZEMOVE\n(开始拖动)
  Resizing --> Active : WM_EXITSIZEMOVE\n(结束拖动)\n+ OnResize()
}

运行中 --> [*] : WM_DESTROY\nPostQuitMessage(0)

note right of Active
  **活跃状态行为：**
  • 计时器运行
  • UpdateScene(dt)
  • DrawScene()
  • CalculateFrameStats()
end note

note right of Paused
  **暂停状态行为：**
  • 计时器停止
  • 跳过更新和渲染
  • 降低 CPU 占用
end note

note bottom of Resizing
  **调整大小时：**
  • 暂停更新以避免频繁重建资源
  • 完成后调用 OnResize() 一次
  • 重建渲染目标和深度缓冲区
end note

@enduml
